<title>UK: Pentland names Webster finance director.</title>
<headline>Pentland names Webster finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British sports, leisure and fashion brand management group Pentland Group Plc said on Tuesday it has appointed Nicholas Webster as finance director from April 14.</p>
<p>Webster, who will replace Frank Farrant, is currently finance director of William Baird Plc, Pentland said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
